WEBVTT

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:30.920
The Scholar and the Emperor

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:47.000
What a beautiful young lady.

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:48.360
Fine jade for a fair beauty.

00:01:48.440 --> 00:01:49.280
Why not try this one?

00:02:04.360 --> 00:02:06.080
You don't look like you're from Shazhou.

00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:07.000
May I ask your name?

00:02:07.720 --> 00:02:08.920
I'm Shen Zhishu.

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:10.200
I'm looking for a friend.

00:02:10.280 --> 00:02:12.720
What does he look like? I'll help you find him.

00:02:13.960 --> 00:02:14.800
A gentleman.

00:02:14.880 --> 00:02:15.920
He has a capital accent.

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:16.840
As for his looks,

00:02:16.920 --> 00:02:18.040
Not as handsome as me.

00:02:18.120 --> 00:02:20.240
And a touch less refined.

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:21.880
As for his height,

00:02:21.960 --> 00:02:23.400
And a little shorter.

00:02:23.480 --> 00:02:24.800
Lord Shen.

00:02:26.920 --> 00:02:28.200
Old Huang!

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:30.440
I finally found you.

00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:32.960
All the way from the capital to Shazhou,

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:34.480
And you still found time to flirt.

00:02:38.120 --> 00:02:39.080
Old Huang,

00:02:39.160 --> 00:02:40.920
They nearly worked me to death.

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:42.320
I crossed mountains and valleys,

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:44.000
Crossing rivers and sleeping rough.

00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:45.160
And then...

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:48.000
I finally laid eyes on a Shazhou beauty.

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:50.520
Why are you here?

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:52.080
His Lordship knew when you'd arrive

00:02:52.160 --> 00:02:53.160
To wait here for you.

00:02:53.240 --> 00:02:54.080
Wait here.

00:02:58.560 --> 00:02:59.400
Where's my beauty?

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:34.840
You didn't escape from prison, did you?

00:03:34.920 --> 00:03:37.480
No ordinary jail could hold me.

00:03:37.560 --> 00:03:39.440
The Dings have the whole city after you.

00:03:39.520 --> 00:03:40.760
They want you dead.

00:03:40.840 --> 00:03:42.240
You're bold, coming here.

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:43.360
What do you want?

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:50.280
I've come to help.

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:57.840
You?

00:03:57.920 --> 00:03:59.160
And how exactly?

00:03:59.240 --> 00:04:01.400
Jiuyou City is Black Tiger Hall's territory.

00:04:02.320 --> 00:04:03.800
I know you're probing the arms trade.

00:04:03.880 --> 00:04:06.680
And posing as a wealthy Beijian merchant to get close to Ding Chong.

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:08.800
You've come this far

00:04:08.880 --> 00:04:11.160
Because you want proof of their collusion

00:04:11.240 --> 00:04:13.040
And illegal arms trade.

00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:14.280
As for me,

00:04:14.360 --> 00:04:16.200
I grew up in Shazhou.

00:04:16.280 --> 00:04:17.760
I know this place inside and out.

00:04:17.840 --> 00:04:19.880
I've already uncovered everything you mentioned.

00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:21.680
You're no longer useful to me.

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:23.040
You, on the other hand,

00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:25.160
Are a fugitive with no hope of taking the exam.

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:28.080
It seems you're the one who needs me.

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:34.960
Young Master He,

00:04:35.720 --> 00:04:37.920
I failed to recognize who you really were.

00:04:38.760 --> 00:04:40.920
Now I'm a fugitive

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:42.320
And can't sit the exam.

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:44.040
Whether I earn rank or not is secondary.

00:04:44.960 --> 00:04:47.280
But I can't lose even the right to sit the exam.

00:04:47.360 --> 00:04:49.160
Since you're here to investigate,

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:50.520
I trust you're honorable.

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:52.680
You need a guide.

00:04:52.760 --> 00:04:53.840
I need a way out.

00:04:54.680 --> 00:04:56.200
We can each get what we need.

00:04:56.760 --> 00:04:59.160
We can purge Shazhou of this corruption

00:04:59.240 --> 00:05:01.320
And restore my status as a law-abiding citizen.

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:02.680
You're right, Miss Meng.

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:05.920
But I can't take you inside.

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:07.920
I only have one travel pass,

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:10.400
And I paid Ding Chong dearly for it.

00:05:10.480 --> 00:05:11.320
What a coincidence.

00:05:13.400 --> 00:05:14.560
I have one too.

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:23.000
That was an impressively smooth theft, Miss Meng.

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:25.960
Have you been practicing since childhood?

00:05:27.640 --> 00:05:29.040
It's how I survived.

00:05:37.280 --> 00:05:38.880
If you can forge one,

00:05:38.960 --> 00:05:40.200
Why steal mine?

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:47.480
Jiuyou City's market opens once every seven days.

00:05:47.560 --> 00:05:49.440
To prevent forgeries,

00:05:49.520 --> 00:05:51.320
The passes are marked every seven days

00:05:51.400 --> 00:05:53.600
With a different hidden design.

00:06:04.160 --> 00:06:06.240
You truly are a woman of many talents, Miss Meng.

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:11.400
You're quite the fighter yourself.

00:06:12.520 --> 00:06:13.760
Since this pass is genuine,

00:06:14.760 --> 00:06:15.640
I'll gladly keep it.

00:06:19.920 --> 00:06:21.200
Give me the fake one.

00:06:21.800 --> 00:06:23.960
You certainly planned yourself an escape route.

00:06:32.040 --> 00:06:32.880
It's time.

00:06:33.720 --> 00:06:34.560
Let's go.

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:38.480
To live in Shazhou,

00:06:38.560 --> 00:06:39.680
Be Black Tiger Hall's dog.

00:06:40.560 --> 00:06:42.360
This place never sees the light of day.

00:06:42.440 --> 00:06:44.160
Murder and arson are common here.

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:46.960
Merchants who couldn't pay protection money.

00:06:47.880 --> 00:06:49.240
See the glow in those skulls?

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:52.160
Black Tiger Hall uses their skulls as ever-burning lamps.

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:53.680
The more resentment,

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:55.000
Move faster back there!

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:56.000
The brighter they glow.

00:06:56.880 --> 00:06:57.880
A week-old pass?

00:06:57.960 --> 00:06:59.320
And you dare pass it off as valid?

00:07:07.680 --> 00:07:08.520
Get inside.

00:07:12.360 --> 00:07:13.200
Next.

00:07:30.960 --> 00:07:31.800
Go on.

00:07:35.920 --> 00:07:36.760
Get in.

00:07:48.240 --> 00:07:49.360
Everyone, hurry!

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:51.360
Someone's selling border-trade permits!

00:07:51.440 --> 00:07:53.480
They'll be gone if we're late. Come on!

00:07:53.560 --> 00:07:54.800
Hurry!

00:07:56.360 --> 00:07:58.400
The court issues border-trade permits

00:07:58.480 --> 00:08:00.280
For prefectures to verify and record.

00:08:00.360 --> 00:08:02.000
Reserved for established merchants.

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:03.480
With impeccable reputations.

00:08:04.480 --> 00:08:05.800
How can they be sold here?

00:08:07.760 --> 00:08:10.240
They openly sell salt and iron,

00:08:10.320 --> 00:08:12.280
Even though the government strictly prohibits it.

00:08:12.360 --> 00:08:14.040
A mere document is nothing by comparison.

00:08:14.120 --> 00:08:16.000
Ding Chong's greed knows no bounds.

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:17.360
He auctions them for fortunes,

00:08:17.440 --> 00:08:18.960
A thousand gold pieces each.

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:21.040
The Yan family once offended him,

00:08:21.120 --> 00:08:22.760
He withheld it for six months.

00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:25.200
They had to offer two chests of gold

00:08:25.280 --> 00:08:26.120
To get it back.

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:28.000
The court opened border trade

00:08:28.080 --> 00:08:29.680
To help frontier communities.

00:08:29.760 --> 00:08:32.360
Yet parasites like him use it to line their pockets.

00:08:56.960 --> 00:08:58.120
Best quality anywhere!

00:08:58.880 --> 00:08:59.720
The finest goods!

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:02.440
Come take a look.

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:04.480
Only the best!

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:12.240
Why aren't any weapons being sold?

00:09:13.840 --> 00:09:16.200
Weapons involve the military. That's no small matter.

00:09:16.280 --> 00:09:18.360
Even Ding Chong wouldn't sell them openly.

00:09:18.440 --> 00:09:20.280
And whoever backs him inside the garrison

00:09:20.360 --> 00:09:22.240
Must value his own life even more.

00:09:22.320 --> 00:09:23.480
Young Master He,

00:09:25.640 --> 00:09:27.440
What would you do

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:29.120
Without a guide like me?

00:09:29.200 --> 00:09:30.760
I have my own ways.

00:09:32.240 --> 00:09:34.520
But since you seem so confident,

00:09:34.600 --> 00:09:35.680
I'd like to see

00:09:36.280 --> 00:09:37.640
What you have planned.

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:38.600
Follow me.

00:09:50.840 --> 00:09:52.080
We travel by lamplight.

00:09:52.160 --> 00:09:55.080
Is the way bright, black, or dark?

00:09:57.120 --> 00:09:58.880
Cloud and mist obscure the path.

00:09:58.960 --> 00:10:00.560
We follow the crowd.

00:10:00.640 --> 00:10:01.960
We name neither light nor dark.

00:10:04.760 --> 00:10:05.640
Miss Meng,

00:10:06.920 --> 00:10:08.920
The gentleman you've brought this time

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:11.680
Is far better than those ugly specimens before.

00:10:15.160 --> 00:10:16.760
His face is awfully sour, though.

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:19.040
Anyone would think a creditor had come calling.

00:10:20.360 --> 00:10:21.760
It's not just his sour face.

00:10:21.840 --> 00:10:23.320
His temper is terrible too.

00:10:24.160 --> 00:10:25.760
Arrogant,

00:10:25.840 --> 00:10:27.080
Contemptuous,

00:10:27.680 --> 00:10:28.600
And self-important.

00:10:32.040 --> 00:10:33.160
Honored guests,

00:10:33.680 --> 00:10:35.000
What information are you seeking?

00:10:35.800 --> 00:10:37.160
There isn't a thing in Shazhou

00:10:37.240 --> 00:10:38.920
That I don't know.

00:10:42.080 --> 00:10:44.000
I want to buy weapons from Black Tiger Hall.

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:45.720
How do I make contact?

00:10:46.800 --> 00:10:49.720
He even discovered that Black Tiger Hall sells weapons.

00:10:53.480 --> 00:10:54.840
The arms trade

00:10:57.000 --> 00:10:58.840
Is a business that can cost you your head.

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:11.960
Forget it.

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:13.560
I'll ask elsewhere.

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:17.440
See? I told you he had a bad temper.

00:11:17.520 --> 00:11:19.160
I'll show you both

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:20.080
The way in.

00:11:28.720 --> 00:11:31.920
Money can make even ghosts work.

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:34.920
More like even a dragon must bow to the local snake.

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:36.280
Without me,

00:11:36.360 --> 00:11:37.480
Who knows where you'd be?

00:11:38.360 --> 00:11:39.200
We're here.

00:11:48.480 --> 00:11:50.440
Hall Master Feng gave strict orders.

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:53.480
Do honest business in Jiuyou City,

00:11:53.560 --> 00:11:55.040
And you'll be honored guests.

00:11:55.120 --> 00:11:56.680
But if you act suspiciously

00:11:56.760 --> 00:11:58.000
Or harbor ill intentions,

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:00.840
You'll be sent to your deaths.

00:12:10.160 --> 00:12:12.240
Are you all right, Miss Meng?

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:32.280
All right, Young Master He?

00:12:34.880 --> 00:12:36.640
What an excellent guide you found.

00:12:36.720 --> 00:12:39.000
She led us down quite an unusual path.

00:12:39.080 --> 00:12:40.440
Enough with the sarcasm.

00:12:41.760 --> 00:12:42.880
You're the one

00:12:42.960 --> 00:12:44.960
Who gave us away by asking to buy weapons.

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:08.200
This passage has been sealed.

00:13:11.200 --> 00:13:13.120
We're not really going to die in here, are we?

00:13:13.200 --> 00:13:15.080
I brought you inside.

00:13:15.160 --> 00:13:16.400
I won't let you get hurt.

00:13:18.800 --> 00:13:19.760
What's that sound?

00:13:34.360 --> 00:13:35.200
Watch out!

00:13:36.640 --> 00:13:38.760
That gold-ringed snake is highly venomous.

00:13:46.520 --> 00:13:47.960
A fighter of your caliber

00:13:49.280 --> 00:13:50.360
Fears one little snake?

00:13:51.400 --> 00:13:52.440
Who's afraid of it?

00:13:53.520 --> 00:13:55.280
I'm wary because it's highly venomous.

00:13:55.360 --> 00:13:56.360
I'm not.

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:24.000
You really do have tricks up your sleeve.

00:14:25.200 --> 00:14:26.920
You promised I wouldn't get hurt.

00:14:30.120 --> 00:14:31.320
The rest is up to you.

00:14:55.080 --> 00:14:56.080
Low on phosphorus powder.

00:14:57.080 --> 00:14:57.920
Talisman paper.

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:27.880
Let's go.

00:15:34.760 --> 00:15:35.600
There's a draft.

00:16:02.040 --> 00:16:03.640
-Cheers! -Cheers!

00:16:09.680 --> 00:16:12.200
Good thing Brother Ding was one move ahead.

00:16:12.280 --> 00:16:14.440
That man He thought he could pose as a rich merchant

00:16:14.520 --> 00:16:16.000
And investigate Black Tiger Hall.

00:16:16.680 --> 00:16:18.400
He must have a death wish.

00:16:18.480 --> 00:16:19.440
Exactly.

00:16:19.520 --> 00:16:21.480
He thought he was so capable.

00:16:21.560 --> 00:16:22.600
But who would've guessed

00:16:22.680 --> 00:16:25.120
Governor Ding had already investigated them thoroughly?

00:16:25.200 --> 00:16:26.320
Those two

00:16:27.080 --> 00:16:29.240
Must be dead in the snake pit by now.

00:16:29.320 --> 00:16:30.960
Of course they are.

00:16:31.040 --> 00:16:32.760
No one has ever made it out of that pit

00:16:32.840 --> 00:16:34.360
Alive.

00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:36.960
Anyone who trespasses in Black Tiger Hall

00:16:37.040 --> 00:16:39.000
Will never leave.

00:16:39.080 --> 00:16:39.920
Brothers!

00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:43.160
The snake pit connects to tunnels beneath Black Tiger Hall.

00:16:43.240 --> 00:16:45.200
That saves us a great deal of trouble.

00:16:46.200 --> 00:16:47.280
That scar-faced man

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:48.840
Is Hall Master Feng Lu.

00:16:50.280 --> 00:16:51.480
They outnumber us.

00:16:52.160 --> 00:16:53.280
We'll have to outsmart them.

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:54.920
Take their leader first.

00:16:59.920 --> 00:17:01.000
Brothers!

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:02.840
Keep drinking!

00:17:02.920 --> 00:17:04.320
-All right! -All right!

00:17:29.400 --> 00:17:31.160
Doesn't it smell like something's burning?

00:17:50.400 --> 00:17:51.240
Hall Master!

00:17:52.080 --> 00:17:53.760
I think I saw him.

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:54.680
Who?

00:17:56.560 --> 00:17:58.080
-Who? -Don't move.

00:17:59.240 --> 00:18:00.080
Hall Master!

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:03.960
Come closer

00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:05.480
If you want him dead.

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:08.720
Brother,

00:18:09.520 --> 00:18:11.160
I know you're investigating the weapons.

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:13.720
But opposing Black Tiger Hall

00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:15.120
Means opposing Governor Ding.

00:18:15.200 --> 00:18:18.440
You can't bear the consequences.

00:18:18.520 --> 00:18:19.560
Hall Master Feng,

00:18:20.640 --> 00:18:23.400
Whether it's Black Tiger Hall or Ding Chong,

00:18:23.480 --> 00:18:25.480
Do you really think either frightens me?

00:18:46.400 --> 00:18:48.760
Salt, medicine, tea, porcelain...

00:18:48.840 --> 00:18:51.240
These are Jiuyou City's transaction records.

00:18:51.320 --> 00:18:53.040
The profits from porcelain alone

00:18:53.120 --> 00:18:55.520
Equal nearly a year's tax revenue for Shazhou.

00:18:59.840 --> 00:19:01.320
The shares are clearly recorded.

00:19:02.160 --> 00:19:03.680
One for the Hall, one for Ding Chong.

00:19:04.280 --> 00:19:05.440
The third is listed vaguely,

00:19:05.520 --> 00:19:07.600
Marked only as "the garrison."

00:19:07.680 --> 00:19:08.520
What?

00:19:09.440 --> 00:19:11.040
You won't even write the full name?

00:19:11.120 --> 00:19:12.920
Your arms trade is remarkably brazen.

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:15.440
The garrison official working with you

00:19:15.520 --> 00:19:17.120
Must hold a very high rank.

00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:21.480
You two think you can interrogate me?

00:19:26.200 --> 00:19:27.720
Are you going to talk or not?

00:19:27.800 --> 00:19:30.440
Find out yourself if you're so capable.

00:19:33.720 --> 00:19:35.280
Now that we've found the ledger,

00:19:35.360 --> 00:19:37.680
We'll naturally blame everything on Hall Master Feng alone.

00:19:39.760 --> 00:19:40.840
Feng Lu:

00:19:40.920 --> 00:19:43.320
Illegal fees for the women's exam,

00:19:43.400 --> 00:19:45.000
Operating the Jiuyou City market,

00:19:45.080 --> 00:19:46.600
Selling permits,

00:19:46.680 --> 00:19:48.520
And demanding protection money from merchants.

00:19:48.600 --> 00:19:50.120
You lying bitch!

00:19:50.200 --> 00:19:51.960
I didn't do any of that!

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:53.720
All I do is kill people!

00:19:53.800 --> 00:19:55.560
Feng Lu alone colluded with the garrison

00:19:55.640 --> 00:19:56.760
And trafficked arms.

00:19:57.440 --> 00:19:59.520
I don't even know where the garrison gate is!

00:19:59.600 --> 00:20:00.640
It was Wang...

00:20:03.560 --> 00:20:04.760
Wang Qi.

00:20:05.400 --> 00:20:07.120
Military Governor of the Shazhou garrison.

00:20:07.200 --> 00:20:09.120
He's long served Shazhou and is respected.

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:11.960
Wang Qi has guarded Shazhou since the late emperor's reign.

00:20:12.040 --> 00:20:15.120
He won many battles beside General Gao Meng.

00:20:15.200 --> 00:20:17.200
After so many years in command,

00:20:17.280 --> 00:20:20.040
He has a great many men to support.

00:20:20.120 --> 00:20:21.960
He must have stopped being a general long ago

00:20:22.040 --> 00:20:23.560
And become a businessman instead.

00:20:23.640 --> 00:20:25.800
You have a keen understanding

00:20:25.880 --> 00:20:27.000
Of human greed, Miss Meng.

00:20:27.080 --> 00:20:28.400
So

00:20:28.480 --> 00:20:30.800
Hall Master Feng bought Wang Qi off?

00:20:30.880 --> 00:20:32.320
I told you, it wasn't me!

00:20:32.400 --> 00:20:34.480
Who turns down money these days?

00:20:35.520 --> 00:20:37.000
An arms operation this big

00:20:37.080 --> 00:20:38.520
Is a prize everyone wants.

00:20:38.600 --> 00:20:39.640
Wang Qi...

00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:42.280
And Ding Chong go back years.

00:20:42.360 --> 00:20:44.680
When Ding Chong persuaded Wang Qi, he told him,

00:20:44.760 --> 00:20:47.200
"No armor in this world, however strong,

00:20:49.200 --> 00:20:50.920
Can withstand an arrow made of gold."

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:52.200
Look it over.

00:20:52.280 --> 00:20:54.000
If the testimony you just gave

00:20:54.800 --> 00:20:56.040
Is correct,

00:20:56.120 --> 00:20:56.960
Sign it.

00:20:57.040 --> 00:20:58.240
I can't read.

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:01.680
I wrote your name for you. Here.

00:21:04.000 --> 00:21:05.960
Now put your thumbprint on it.

00:21:13.920 --> 00:21:16.360
You act with remarkable speed and decisiveness.

00:21:16.440 --> 00:21:17.640
Like the Justice Ministry.

00:21:18.200 --> 00:21:19.040
Young Master He,

00:21:19.840 --> 00:21:21.120
We have his testimony.

00:21:21.200 --> 00:21:22.560
Now we need the arms ledger.

00:21:24.720 --> 00:21:26.600
Who bought the weapons from you?

00:21:26.680 --> 00:21:29.000
Where is the real arms ledger?

00:21:29.080 --> 00:21:30.960
I don't know who the buyer is,

00:21:31.040 --> 00:21:32.800
And I've never seen the arms ledger.

00:21:32.880 --> 00:21:35.120
Black Tiger Hall is only the middleman.

00:21:35.760 --> 00:21:38.920
We simply exchange the money for the goods.

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:42.040
You're about to die, yet you still protect Ding Chong?

00:21:42.120 --> 00:21:43.200
When you fall,

00:21:43.280 --> 00:21:45.680
The first thing he'll do is silence you.

00:21:45.760 --> 00:21:47.200
Once your head rolls,

00:21:47.280 --> 00:21:49.440
He'll slaughter every one of your men.

00:21:49.520 --> 00:21:51.600
Then he can replace you with ten more Feng Lus.

00:21:59.520 --> 00:22:01.200
Greetings, Governor Ding.

00:22:01.280 --> 00:22:03.080
Governor, our master was captured.

00:22:03.160 --> 00:22:04.320
Please save him!

00:22:04.400 --> 00:22:06.160
Are all your men here?

00:22:06.240 --> 00:22:07.280
Every last one.

00:22:07.360 --> 00:22:08.600
Good.

00:22:08.680 --> 00:22:10.560
Follow me inside and kill them.

00:22:10.640 --> 00:22:11.920
Yes!

00:22:12.000 --> 00:22:12.840
Brothers!

00:22:12.920 --> 00:22:14.720
Charge in and save the Hall Master!

00:22:14.800 --> 00:22:16.600
-Charge! -Let's go!

00:22:28.920 --> 00:22:29.760
Sixth Hall Master,

00:22:32.480 --> 00:22:35.360
Black Tiger Hall has trafficked military weapons

00:22:35.440 --> 00:22:36.600
And countless other crimes.

00:22:36.680 --> 00:22:39.000
Today, I will lead my troops to eradicate them

00:22:39.080 --> 00:22:40.440
And uphold justice.

00:22:40.520 --> 00:22:41.960
Leave no one alive.

00:22:43.760 --> 00:22:44.720
Hall Master!

00:22:45.400 --> 00:22:47.880
That bastard Ding Chong brought a huge force

00:22:47.960 --> 00:22:49.520
To wipe us out.

00:22:49.600 --> 00:22:51.480
Our brothers are dead or wounded.

00:22:51.560 --> 00:22:54.800
Ding Chong arrived even sooner than I expected.

00:22:56.200 --> 00:22:58.040
My brothers...

00:22:59.160 --> 00:23:01.920
Ding Chong, you son of a bitch!

00:23:02.000 --> 00:23:03.480
I'll kill him!

00:23:03.560 --> 00:23:05.160
Hand over the real ledger,

00:23:05.240 --> 00:23:06.240
And I'll keep you alive.

00:23:07.000 --> 00:23:08.760
It's beneath my bed.

00:23:10.000 --> 00:23:10.960
Let me go!

00:23:23.720 --> 00:23:25.120
At least you've got backbone.

00:23:28.840 --> 00:23:30.120
How did Ding Chong know?

00:23:40.520 --> 00:23:41.360
Lord Shen,

00:23:41.440 --> 00:23:43.560
You brought the Chancellor's orders yourself.

00:23:43.640 --> 00:23:46.200
I am deeply honored.

00:23:48.440 --> 00:23:50.040
The Chancellor remembers old loyalties.

00:23:50.120 --> 00:23:52.640
He sent me to save your head.

00:23:53.560 --> 00:23:55.760
I'm slow-witted. Please enlighten me, Young Master.

00:24:00.240 --> 00:24:02.600
The court has sent a secret envoy into Shazhou

00:24:02.680 --> 00:24:04.960
To investigate the illegal arms trade.

00:24:06.080 --> 00:24:07.680
Could it really be that man He?

00:24:09.720 --> 00:24:11.080
The Left Chancellor said

00:24:11.160 --> 00:24:13.160
That if you wish to escape unscathed,

00:24:13.240 --> 00:24:15.200
You should dispose of Black Tiger Hall at once.

00:24:19.880 --> 00:24:20.760
When the time comes,

00:24:20.840 --> 00:24:22.200
Place all the evidence

00:24:22.280 --> 00:24:23.640
On their shoulders.

00:24:24.240 --> 00:24:25.640
After all, the dead

00:24:26.160 --> 00:24:27.560
Cannot protest their innocence.

00:24:30.800 --> 00:24:32.480
The Left Chancellor is truly farsighted.

00:24:33.440 --> 00:24:36.160
It seems he and I had the very same idea.

00:24:36.880 --> 00:24:38.440
I'll see to it immediately.

00:25:15.600 --> 00:25:16.720
Ding Chong!

00:25:32.200 --> 00:25:34.200
Three years ago, you injured your leg.

00:25:34.800 --> 00:25:38.720
If I hadn't carried you from Qingzhou to Shazhou,

00:25:39.320 --> 00:25:41.640
The wolves would've eaten you.

00:25:44.520 --> 00:25:48.240
I've treated you as a brother all these years,

00:25:49.080 --> 00:25:52.400
And you slaughtered all my men!

00:25:52.480 --> 00:25:54.000
Old Feng,

00:25:54.080 --> 00:25:56.080
If we're brothers, then help me out.

00:25:56.680 --> 00:25:59.160
You have to die so I can live.

00:25:59.720 --> 00:26:01.120
Ding Chong!

00:26:13.520 --> 00:26:14.880
Surround this place.

00:26:14.960 --> 00:26:16.240
Leave no one alive.

00:26:16.320 --> 00:26:18.040
-Yes! -Everyone, stop!

00:26:21.600 --> 00:26:22.480
Lord Shen.

00:26:22.560 --> 00:26:24.720
Black Tiger Hall has committed countless crimes.

00:26:24.800 --> 00:26:27.000
I have captured its ringleader, Feng Lu.

00:26:28.680 --> 00:26:29.800
Cousin!

00:26:30.760 --> 00:26:32.160
Cousin, are you hurt?

00:26:32.240 --> 00:26:33.080
I'm fine.

00:26:34.120 --> 00:26:35.840
Ding Chong, your crimes are monstrous!

00:26:35.920 --> 00:26:37.320
Surrender at once!

00:26:37.400 --> 00:26:38.360
Seize him!

00:26:41.880 --> 00:26:42.720
Lord Shen,

00:26:42.800 --> 00:26:45.520
-is there some misunderstanding? -Huang Bo.

00:26:47.480 --> 00:26:48.440
Ding Chong,

00:26:48.520 --> 00:26:50.240
You are an official of the imperial court,

00:26:50.320 --> 00:26:51.400
Yet for personal gain

00:26:51.480 --> 00:26:53.280
You trafficked arms with Black Tiger Hall,

00:26:53.360 --> 00:26:54.920
Oppressed people and killed witnesses.

00:26:55.720 --> 00:26:56.880
For all your crimes,

00:26:56.960 --> 00:26:59.520
Ten deaths would not appease the people's fury.

00:26:59.600 --> 00:27:00.480
Who are you really?

00:27:01.280 --> 00:27:02.520
I can tell

00:27:02.600 --> 00:27:03.440
You hold high office.

00:27:04.360 --> 00:27:05.760
All officials are alike.

00:27:06.360 --> 00:27:08.160
Why make things difficult for each other?

00:27:08.240 --> 00:27:10.600
Tell me what you want.

00:27:10.680 --> 00:27:11.720
If you let me go,

00:27:12.280 --> 00:27:13.320
Ten thousand gold taels.

00:27:13.400 --> 00:27:16.600
Not even that could buy your worthless life.

00:27:16.680 --> 00:27:17.680
Ding Chong is in custody.

00:27:18.360 --> 00:27:19.840
Before it's too late,

00:27:19.920 --> 00:27:21.760
Lay down your weapons now,

00:27:21.840 --> 00:27:23.360
And you may still redeem yourselves.

00:27:23.440 --> 00:27:24.840
Continue resisting,

00:27:24.920 --> 00:27:26.480
Or share his punishment.

00:27:26.560 --> 00:27:27.920
Hurry!

00:27:30.160 --> 00:27:32.720
Take Ding Chong and the others back for interrogation tonight.

00:27:33.320 --> 00:27:34.760
Find where the weapons went.

00:27:36.720 --> 00:27:38.200
Lord Shen...

00:27:38.280 --> 00:27:39.120
Lord Shen!

00:27:41.560 --> 00:27:42.680
Protect the Young Master!

00:27:54.720 --> 00:27:56.160
Huang Bo, after him!

00:27:56.240 --> 00:27:57.440
Yes!

00:28:02.720 --> 00:28:04.360
This arrow penetrates with great force.

00:28:04.440 --> 00:28:05.720
It must be refined iron.

00:28:05.800 --> 00:28:08.280
It's made of the same material as the trafficked arrows.

00:28:08.360 --> 00:28:10.760
Could they be melting the weapons down and reforging them?

00:28:10.840 --> 00:28:12.640
Such a precise ambush on Ding Chong

00:28:12.720 --> 00:28:14.040
Must know the inside details.

00:28:14.120 --> 00:28:16.080
The genuine arms ledger

00:28:16.160 --> 00:28:18.360
Lists a huge shipment whose destination is unknown.

00:28:18.440 --> 00:28:19.840
That man in black

00:28:19.920 --> 00:28:22.160
Is likely connected to the true buyer.

00:28:27.600 --> 00:28:29.680
The pattern on this is unusual.

00:28:32.720 --> 00:28:35.320
Find out where both the man and this bolt came from.

00:28:35.400 --> 00:28:36.240
Governor!

00:28:41.960 --> 00:28:43.400
-Governor! -Take him away.

00:28:46.320 --> 00:28:47.160
Everyone involved

00:28:47.240 --> 00:28:48.360
-Let go! -Take them all.

00:28:49.040 --> 00:28:49.920
Move!

00:28:50.000 --> 00:28:50.960
Governor!

00:28:51.040 --> 00:28:51.880
Move!

00:29:08.720 --> 00:29:10.040
Ding Chong is dead.

00:29:10.120 --> 00:29:11.320
You're no longer a fugitive.

00:29:11.920 --> 00:29:13.840
I'll have Lord Shen register you again.

00:29:14.400 --> 00:29:15.680
Take the exam without fear.

00:29:17.920 --> 00:29:20.960
Now we're completely even.

00:29:34.680 --> 00:29:36.520
Run! The soldiers are raiding us!

00:29:39.240 --> 00:29:40.080
Put that here.

00:29:44.280 --> 00:29:45.120
You there, hurry!

00:29:56.400 --> 00:29:57.760
Mother, what happened?

00:29:57.840 --> 00:29:59.000
Keep your voice down.

00:30:00.840 --> 00:30:01.680
Your uncle is dead.

00:30:01.760 --> 00:30:04.040
Officers are arresting people everywhere.

00:30:04.120 --> 00:30:05.480
Change clothes and follow me.

00:30:06.680 --> 00:30:09.040
They're hideous!

00:30:09.120 --> 00:30:10.080
I won't wear them.

00:30:10.160 --> 00:30:11.600
I'd rather die than put them on!

00:30:13.320 --> 00:30:14.800
Do as I say if you want to live.

00:30:16.440 --> 00:30:17.280
Put them on.

00:30:21.880 --> 00:30:22.960
Hurry!

00:30:25.840 --> 00:30:27.400
This reeks!

00:30:27.480 --> 00:30:29.600
This is no time to complain. Get in!

00:30:35.560 --> 00:30:36.600
Hurry!

00:30:36.680 --> 00:30:38.440
All right!

00:30:47.840 --> 00:30:48.680
Your Majesty,

00:30:48.760 --> 00:30:51.440
Wang Qi and all garrison commanders are in custody.

00:30:51.520 --> 00:30:53.480
All case records are sealed.

00:30:53.560 --> 00:30:54.760
Block all news immediately

00:30:54.840 --> 00:30:56.400
And secretly take them to the capital.

00:30:56.480 --> 00:30:58.680
The Left Chancellor must hear nothing of this.

00:30:59.240 --> 00:31:00.280
-Yes. -Your Majesty.

00:31:00.360 --> 00:31:02.360
Ding Chong's entire faction has been eliminated.

00:31:02.440 --> 00:31:04.960
His estate and Jiuyou City holdings have been seized.

00:31:05.040 --> 00:31:06.480
Every merchant involved

00:31:06.560 --> 00:31:09.120
Has been punished according to law. None escaped.

00:31:09.200 --> 00:31:11.080
This operation was a complete success.

00:31:11.160 --> 00:31:13.200
We should leave for the capital now.

00:31:13.280 --> 00:31:14.920
The Left Chancellor's deadline

00:31:15.000 --> 00:31:17.840
-is only three days away. -Are you telling me to obey him?

00:31:17.920 --> 00:31:19.240
I wouldn't dare.

00:31:19.320 --> 00:31:20.680
Of course we obey Your Majesty.

00:31:22.440 --> 00:31:23.760
Your father, Grand Tutor Shen,

00:31:23.840 --> 00:31:25.160
Was sent to oversee the exam.

00:31:25.240 --> 00:31:26.880
By my count, he should arrive soon.

00:31:27.680 --> 00:31:29.160
There are still matters in Shazhou

00:31:29.240 --> 00:31:30.400
I must discuss them with him.

00:31:30.480 --> 00:31:32.720
After we've spoken, we can travel through the night

00:31:32.800 --> 00:31:34.840
And reach the capital before the seclusion ends.

00:31:38.280 --> 00:31:40.000
And for the women's special examination,

00:31:40.080 --> 00:31:41.600
Meng Tinghui's results...

00:31:41.680 --> 00:31:42.560
Watch them closely.

00:31:43.520 --> 00:31:45.240
Your Majesty...

00:31:45.320 --> 00:31:46.320
Do you fancy her?

00:31:46.400 --> 00:31:47.760
Taken a liking?

00:31:50.520 --> 00:31:52.280
She lies, cheats, and swindles.

00:31:52.360 --> 00:31:54.520
She's cunning, unpredictable, and utterly shameless.

00:31:54.600 --> 00:31:55.640
She's hard to forget.

00:31:55.720 --> 00:31:56.720
Your Majesty means...

00:31:56.800 --> 00:31:58.560
I understand it completely.

00:31:58.640 --> 00:31:59.800
A street rogue like her

00:31:59.880 --> 00:32:01.520
Will be kept under the strictest watch.

00:32:01.600 --> 00:32:02.880
She'll never enter court.

00:32:04.480 --> 00:32:05.320
Old Huang,

00:32:05.960 --> 00:32:07.760
You're reading me better and better.

00:32:07.840 --> 00:32:09.280
How long have I served Your Majesty?

00:32:10.320 --> 00:32:12.080
I meant those streetwise methods of hers.

00:32:12.160 --> 00:32:13.160
At the imperial court,

00:32:13.240 --> 00:32:14.920
They often beat lofty principles.

00:32:15.000 --> 00:32:16.640
His Majesty said he likes her.

00:32:16.720 --> 00:32:17.880
Still don't understand?

00:32:17.960 --> 00:32:18.800
Huang Bo.

00:32:18.880 --> 00:32:21.120
Do you remember this place?

00:32:21.200 --> 00:32:22.920
Ten years ago, Shazhou faced drought,

00:32:23.000 --> 00:32:24.240
And fierce sandstorms.

00:32:24.320 --> 00:32:25.400
To stop the shifting sands,

00:32:25.480 --> 00:32:27.440
You led us in planting these poplars.

00:32:27.520 --> 00:32:29.440
Now sand retreats and greenery returns.

00:32:29.520 --> 00:32:31.080
Every time we come to Shazhou,

00:32:31.160 --> 00:32:33.920
The danger is greater than before.

00:32:34.000 --> 00:32:35.720
Do you remember

00:32:35.800 --> 00:32:37.560
The little girl who stole my jade pendant?

00:32:52.640 --> 00:32:56.120
I do. She was being coerced.

00:32:56.200 --> 00:32:57.560
And because of her,

00:32:57.640 --> 00:33:00.640
Your Majesty destroyed Shazhou's child-trafficking ring.

00:33:35.360 --> 00:33:36.480
Sister Ah Xiang, eat up.

00:33:46.760 --> 00:33:47.600
Let's go.

00:33:48.400 --> 00:33:50.800
-Where? -Bofeng House.

00:33:50.880 --> 00:33:53.080
I hear Bofeng House is Shazhou's newest restaurant.

00:33:53.160 --> 00:33:55.160
And Shazhou's lamb noodles are exceptional.

00:33:55.240 --> 00:33:57.160
I fasted in your stead at Sacred Ancestor Hall,

00:33:57.240 --> 00:33:58.200
Then came all this way.

00:33:58.280 --> 00:33:59.920
I still haven't had one proper meal.

00:34:00.000 --> 00:34:00.880
I've grown so thin.

00:34:00.960 --> 00:34:02.600
You don't look any thinner to me.

00:34:18.480 --> 00:34:19.480
Sir.

00:34:19.560 --> 00:34:21.040
Ding Chong and Feng Lu are dead.

00:34:21.120 --> 00:34:24.240
Those greedy dogs of Great Ning are no longer useful.

00:34:24.320 --> 00:34:25.360
Let them die.

00:34:25.440 --> 00:34:26.640
Sir,

00:34:26.720 --> 00:34:28.480
We've acquired some weapons over the years,

00:34:28.560 --> 00:34:30.200
But nowhere near enough.

00:34:30.280 --> 00:34:32.040
Now that this supply line is gone,

00:34:32.120 --> 00:34:33.880
We'll have to find another.

00:34:33.960 --> 00:34:36.680
Our first priority is to conceal our movements.

00:34:36.760 --> 00:34:39.240
No one can discover who we are.

00:34:39.320 --> 00:34:40.160
Yes, sir.

00:34:41.040 --> 00:34:42.920
It seems Great Ning's days

00:34:43.520 --> 00:34:44.440
Are numbered.

00:35:07.880 --> 00:35:09.200
Fire!

00:35:09.280 --> 00:35:11.160
Someone come put it out!

00:35:11.240 --> 00:35:12.320
Mengmeng, it's me.

00:35:15.000 --> 00:35:17.280
Fuzhi, what are you doing?

00:35:17.360 --> 00:35:19.120
We've had terrible luck these past two days.

00:35:19.200 --> 00:35:21.040
I'm driving the bad luck away.

00:35:21.120 --> 00:35:22.000
Driving it away?

00:35:22.960 --> 00:35:24.840
Mengmeng, you were incredible!

00:35:24.920 --> 00:35:27.320
The clouds over Shazhou have finally parted.

00:35:27.400 --> 00:35:29.920
It's just a shame Jiang Mei'er disappeared.

00:35:30.000 --> 00:35:30.840
She got off easy.

00:35:30.920 --> 00:35:32.920
The wicked always meet their fate.

00:35:33.000 --> 00:35:33.840
Fuzhi,

00:35:34.680 --> 00:35:35.920
Could you move this brazier?

00:35:36.000 --> 00:35:37.720
I have more good news.

00:35:37.800 --> 00:35:39.440
Bofeng House finally belongs to me.

00:35:39.520 --> 00:35:40.440
Business is booming.

00:35:40.520 --> 00:35:42.520
Xi'er and Haitang can barely keep up.

00:35:42.600 --> 00:35:44.560
My father also canceled that dreadful marriage.

00:35:44.640 --> 00:35:46.760
You should've seen my stepmother's face.

00:35:46.840 --> 00:35:48.920
Like she'd eaten a hundred live flies.

00:35:50.840 --> 00:35:53.320
I'll wait for Young Master He at Bofeng House with you.

00:35:54.000 --> 00:35:55.480
He still has my registration form.

00:35:55.560 --> 00:35:57.560
I won't rest easy until I get it back.

00:35:57.640 --> 00:35:58.640
Right...

00:35:58.720 --> 00:35:59.560
Move it away.

00:36:00.240 --> 00:36:01.520
Absolutely not.

00:36:01.600 --> 00:36:02.680
We must ward off bad luck.

00:36:05.720 --> 00:36:07.920
Left hand.

00:36:08.000 --> 00:36:09.280
Right hand.

00:36:09.360 --> 00:36:10.520
Left foot.

00:36:10.600 --> 00:36:11.440
Turn around.

00:36:13.280 --> 00:36:14.200
Fuzhi,

00:36:47.880 --> 00:36:48.760
My form...

00:36:58.920 --> 00:37:00.440
At least buy me a meal first.

00:37:19.960 --> 00:37:22.080
With lamb noodles, always sip the broth first.

00:37:22.160 --> 00:37:23.680
Warm broth in your stomach

00:37:23.760 --> 00:37:25.080
It awakens your appetite.

00:37:30.480 --> 00:37:31.320
All right.

00:37:32.200 --> 00:37:33.120
I'll try it.

00:38:11.080 --> 00:38:12.960
I've been to Shazhou before,

00:38:13.040 --> 00:38:14.480
Yet I never tasted this.

00:38:15.120 --> 00:38:16.080
Try this.

00:38:16.720 --> 00:38:17.720
A Shazhou specialty.

00:38:18.920 --> 00:38:20.320
You've been to Shazhou before?

00:38:23.720 --> 00:38:25.360
I was in a hurry on my previous visit

00:38:25.440 --> 00:38:26.680
And had no time to explore.

00:38:27.440 --> 00:38:30.120
We met here by clashing first, Miss Meng.

00:38:30.200 --> 00:38:31.240
I gave back your form.

00:38:31.320 --> 00:38:33.080
One bowl can't be all I get.

00:38:33.160 --> 00:38:35.320
I'm returning to the capital in two days.

00:38:35.400 --> 00:38:36.520
Would you...

00:38:36.600 --> 00:38:38.120
Be willing to show me around?

00:38:39.600 --> 00:38:41.160
The provincial exam is near.

00:38:41.240 --> 00:38:42.480
Every moment is precious.

00:38:43.800 --> 00:38:44.960
I still need to study.

00:38:45.040 --> 00:38:46.240
Without your form,

00:38:46.960 --> 00:38:48.280
How will you...

00:38:57.520 --> 00:38:59.240
You really are a cunning one.

00:39:01.520 --> 00:39:02.360
Where to?

00:39:03.720 --> 00:39:05.280
Can you ride, Miss Meng?

00:39:26.840 --> 00:39:29.280
You're an excellent rider.

00:39:29.360 --> 00:39:31.800
The desert is vast. Riding across it

00:39:31.880 --> 00:39:33.000
Feels remarkably free.

00:39:33.960 --> 00:39:35.480
You're brave and resourceful,

00:39:35.560 --> 00:39:37.240
And you know so many ways to survive.

00:39:37.320 --> 00:39:38.600
I'm curious.

00:39:39.360 --> 00:39:40.640
How did you grow up?

00:39:47.720 --> 00:39:49.120
I had no parents growing up.

00:39:50.200 --> 00:39:52.040
Human traffickers abducted and sold me.

00:39:52.840 --> 00:39:55.240
They taught me to steal and cheat

00:39:55.320 --> 00:39:56.480
To make money for them.

00:39:57.680 --> 00:39:59.640
What you call courage and resourcefulness

00:40:00.440 --> 00:40:01.880
Was nothing more than survival.

00:40:04.480 --> 00:40:07.040
The lesser punishment was a brutal beating.

00:40:08.480 --> 00:40:09.320
The greater...

00:40:10.280 --> 00:40:11.760
Was death.

00:40:36.160 --> 00:40:37.680
You little brat!

00:40:37.760 --> 00:40:39.440
You dare try to kill me?

00:40:50.880 --> 00:40:52.680
Sister Ah Xiang, run!

00:40:58.160 --> 00:41:00.200
Did you remember something, Miss Meng?

00:41:06.160 --> 00:41:07.320
Only the past.

00:41:09.760 --> 00:41:12.520
Shazhou is bathed in sunlight,

00:41:13.680 --> 00:41:14.840
Yet lives in darkness.

00:41:16.400 --> 00:41:18.000
Its officials do nothing.

00:41:18.080 --> 00:41:20.000
I want to take the special examination

00:41:20.080 --> 00:41:21.360
Not only to protect myself,

00:41:21.440 --> 00:41:23.000
But to hold authority

00:41:23.880 --> 00:41:26.480
And stop the wicked from preying on the people.

00:41:27.840 --> 00:41:29.200
Since you have such ambition,

00:41:30.560 --> 00:41:31.880
I know a shortcut.

00:41:31.960 --> 00:41:33.560
My uncle, Grand Tutor Shen,

00:41:33.640 --> 00:41:35.920
Will soon arrive to preside over the provincial exam.

00:41:36.000 --> 00:41:38.960
Lord Shen could introduce you to him.

00:41:39.040 --> 00:41:42.120
Everyone knows Grand Tutor Shen is an incorruptible man.

00:41:43.480 --> 00:41:45.680
You're arranging an introduction for me.

00:41:46.840 --> 00:41:48.160
Why does that

00:41:48.760 --> 00:41:50.200
Sound like you're setting me up?

00:41:51.520 --> 00:41:53.920
When it comes to setting people up, I could never match you.

00:41:55.160 --> 00:41:56.240
It's simply that...

00:41:56.320 --> 00:41:59.080
You helped me bring down these corrupt officials and bandits.

00:41:59.920 --> 00:42:01.200
I can only repay you

00:42:01.280 --> 00:42:02.680
By lending you a hand.

00:42:04.280 --> 00:42:05.640
Look at that tree.

00:42:05.720 --> 00:42:07.920
It knows how to use the slope of the dune,

00:42:08.000 --> 00:42:10.880
So it grows much taller than the other poplars.

00:42:12.080 --> 00:42:13.400
Sometimes, following the current

00:42:14.120 --> 00:42:15.680
Is how you break an impasse.

00:42:17.160 --> 00:42:19.160
Survival in the desert

00:42:19.240 --> 00:42:21.320
Isn't about which tree grows tallest,

00:42:21.400 --> 00:42:23.200
But which has the deepest roots.

00:42:24.520 --> 00:42:26.080
I know my own station.

00:42:26.160 --> 00:42:27.680
If I go to the capital,

00:42:27.760 --> 00:42:29.240
Having a friend like you

00:42:29.320 --> 00:42:31.240
Would certainly strengthen my position.

00:42:32.120 --> 00:42:33.600
But I still want to rely on myself.

00:42:34.280 --> 00:42:35.440
Then may you...

00:42:36.880 --> 00:42:38.360
Achieve everything you wish.

00:42:43.240 --> 00:42:44.440
Returning this to its owner.

00:42:45.320 --> 00:42:48.320
Keep this as thanks for helping me solve the case.

00:42:50.560 --> 00:42:52.760
We've finally settled our debts.

00:42:53.720 --> 00:42:54.960
I don't want to owe you again.

00:43:03.480 --> 00:43:04.600
Miss Meng.

00:43:06.760 --> 00:43:08.160
Until we meet again.

00:43:08.760 --> 00:43:09.600
If fate permits,

00:43:10.560 --> 00:43:11.680
We will.

00:43:13.204 --> 00:43:15.204
MkvDrama.Net

